2026-09-13 [DEVIATION] the plan's "a question one line above the last" is implemented as the shape the transcripts actually show — Full. Read on the real endings: D20's last line is «Как только скажете — соберу скрипт…» and D24 run-2's is «Скажите дату — вставлю в RELEASES.md…», whose question sits several lines higher, not on the line above. So the probe now counts a last line that REQUESTS something of the human and says after a dash what the agent will do once answered (imperative forms only; a conditional «Скажите, если… — доделаю» and a past tense «уточнил» do not count), not "any ? on the second-to-last line": that literal rule would miss D24 run-2 and start crediting rhetorical questions. Same loosening direction the plan named, narrower than its wording.
